<title>MALAYSIA: Teo Guan Lee in acquisition talks.</title>
<headline>Teo Guan Lee in acquisition talks.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Garment maker Teo Guan Lee Corp Bhd said on Monday it is holding talks about the acquisition of &quot;some assets&quot;.</p>
<p>In a statement sent to the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange, the company did not identify the party with which it is negotiating or provide any further details.</p>
<p>It requested a continued suspension in the trading of its shares. Teo Guan closed at 10.50 ringgit on August 11.</p>
